{"id":"n74197-1-7","stage":2,"title":"수입 · 收入","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74197-1-7-1","ko":"장사가 잘되어서 수입이 좀 늘었겠네요?","zh":"生意好，收入应该涨了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장사가","meaning":"生意，经商","explanation":"장사：生意，经商；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장사","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71699","senseId":"1","lemma":"장사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘되어서","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수입이","meaning":"收入","explanation":"수입：收入；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수입","audio":"/audio/2b599954c4ba5b32c48f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74197","senseId":"1","lemma":"수입","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘었겠네요?","meaning":"增加，上升","explanation":"늘다：增加，上升；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"늘다","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64492","senseId":"2","lemma":"늘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b5b81ac6a045174c","term":"장사","zh":"生意，经商","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3","entryId":"71699","definition":"为获取利益而买卖东西；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["장사"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"2b599954c4ba5b32","term":"수입","zh":"收入","audio":"/audio/2b599954c4ba5b32c48f.mp3","entryId":"74197","definition":"做某事而收回钱或东西等；或指那样的钱或东西。","pronunciation":["수입"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"0a9915cd5915474e","term":"늘다","zh":"增加，上升","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3","entryId":"64492","definition":"数或量等变得比原来多。","pronunciation":["늘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/77150a138718c6badb05.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74197-1-7-2","ko":"네. 예전보다 두 배 이상 늘었어요.","zh":"是的，增至以前的两倍以上了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예전보다","meaning":"很久以前","explanation":"예전：很久以前；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70090","senseId":"1","lemma":"예전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배","meaning":"倍","explanation":"배：倍","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15901","senseId":"2","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이상","meaning":"以上","explanation":"이상：以上","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"1","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘었어요.","meaning":"增加，上升","explanation":"늘다：增加，上升；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"늘다","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64492","senseId":"2","lemma":"늘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"75497dc0562cdf68","term":"예전","zh":"很久以前","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3","entryId":"70090","definition":"过去很久的往日。","pronunciation":["예ː전"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"倍","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"15901","definition":"表示把某种数量合计几次的数量单位。","pronunciation":["배ː"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"以上","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"数量或程度好于或高于一定基准。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"0a9915cd5915474e","term":"늘다","zh":"增加，上升","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3","entryId":"64492","definition":"数或量等变得比原来多。","pronunciation":["늘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/33347f62dd72cc9c6f46.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.629,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74197","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3543,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，增至以前的两倍以上了。","生意好，收入应该涨了吧？","啊，我想看的电影票已经卖光了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["生意好，收入应该涨了吧？","啊，我想看的电影票已经卖光了。","是的，增至以前的两倍以上了。"],"answer":2}]}
